hypotheses.statement:
For every outcome in $\xi$, every $i<M$, every $n\in W_{e_i}$, and every $t\in[1,2]$, the actual root path of $y_n(t)$ reaches $U$ and rejects children $1,\ldots,i-1$ there. In particular, $$\label{eq:local-hit}
 Q_i(y_n(t))=1
 \quad\Longrightarrow\quad y_n(t)\in B.$$

